o surprises his boss with a cd  he made specifically for michael to play  if he brings someone back to his hotel  room  hello my name is dwight schrute if you  are listening to this you're a lucky  woman  michael has seduced ah to be in your  shoes  against all odds the pair actually  managed to find companionship by the end  of the weekend  dwight with pam's friend isabel and  michael with none other than pam's mom  helene well everyone in the office wants  to look their best at the wedding  there's one co-worker in particular who  tries to step up his game and take his  appearance to the next  level we're talking of course about  everyone's favorite chili expert  and office accountant kevin malone it  all starts with a dramatic toupee  which makes him look younger and boosts  his confidence in the meantime though  kevin suffers a severe wardrobe setback  when he gets to the hotel and puts his  shoes out to be cleaned overnight  rather than being polished he wakes the  next morning to find that they've been  incinerated due to their overpowering  aroma  not one to let a little setback like not  having shoes hold him up  kevin gets inventive and repurposes a  couple tissue boxes to fashion some  experimental footwear  after a long day of dancing and  socializing kevin decides to cool his  aching feet in the hotel's icebox  as he does this he mentions that his  kleenex shoes were a huge conversation  piece he even got some digits i got six  numbers  one more would have been a complete  telephone number  everyone knows and loves that dwight can  be weird at times  actually almost all of the time  nevertheless his quirky behavior reaches  all new levels when he takes part in the  beasley halpert wedding festivities  take for instance how happy he is to  discuss his invention  burger on the go this device is designed  to obtain enough meat  for 6 hamburgers or 12 sliders from a  horse without killing the animal  along with his macabre inventions we  also discover that d